  "applicationText": {
    "title": "北京市街へ",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l25-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "森健太郎到北京的那天，小李和北京分公司的职员马国祥去机场迎接。寒暄后，由小马开车，三人去了市内宾馆。",
        "translationZh": "森健太郎到北京的那天，小李和北京分公司的职员马国祥去机场迎接。寒暄后，由小马开车，三人去了市内宾馆。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "森健太郎到北京的那天，小李和北京分公司的职员马国祥去机场迎接。寒暄后，由小马开车，三人去了市内宾馆。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l25-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "上了车。",
        "translationZh": "上了车。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（上了车）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l25-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l25-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "今日 泊まる ホテルは 天安飯店でしたね。",
            "translationZh": "今天要住的酒店是天安饭店，对吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：今日泊まるホテルは天安飯店でしたね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l25-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson25/l25-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 13.98,
              "duration": 13.98,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:02:35.447Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "1f0de9feb4c5f6ae2cf47500e2785c57225ae9133d2b737eeee037dc79de3238"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l25-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。1か月ぐらい ホテルに 泊まって ください。ゆっくり 住む 所を 探しましょう。",
            "translationZh": "是的。请先在酒店住一个月左右。慢慢找住处吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。1か月ぐらいホテルに泊まってください。ゆっくり住む所を探しましょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l25-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson25/l25-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.7,
              "duration": 4.7,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:02:35.447Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "1f0de9feb4c5f6ae2cf47500e2785c57225ae9133d2b737eeee037dc79de3238"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l25-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "上了高速公路。",
        "translationZh": "上了高速公路。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（上了高速公路）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l25-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l25-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ずいぶん まっすぐな 道路ですね。",
            "translationZh": "这条路真直啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ずいぶんまっすぐな道路ですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l25-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson25/l25-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.86,
              "duration": 1.86,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
